1
00:00:00,300 --> 00:00:02,300
Hello. I'm an AI presenter,

2
00:00:02,300 --> 00:00:03,500
introducing Capital Q.

3
00:00:03,700 --> 00:00:06,500
Private capital still
runs on scattered decks,

4
00:00:06,500 --> 00:00:08,900
partial information
and long email threads.

5
00:00:09,100 --> 00:00:14,300
Capital Q is an investment intelligence
system built around one analyst, called Q.

6
00:00:14,500 --> 00:00:19,300
For investors, Q helps you understand
a company from its own materials,

7
00:00:19,300 --> 00:00:24,500
and shows where each point comes
from and how well it is supported.

8
00:00:24,700 --> 00:00:27,500
It matches opportunities
to your declared mandate,

9
00:00:27,500 --> 00:00:29,500
with reasons you can inspect.

10
00:00:29,700 --> 00:00:32,500
And it helps you progress
qualified relationships,

11
00:00:32,500 --> 00:00:34,500
from first interest to diligence,

12
00:00:34,500 --> 00:00:37,300
while every commercial
decision stays with you.

13
00:00:37,500 --> 00:00:39,900
Founders upload what they already have,

14
00:00:39,900 --> 00:00:42,700
and Q shows what is still missing.

15
00:00:42,900 --> 00:00:47,700
Unicorn Potential is an evidence-based
indicator of what the record supports today.

16
00:00:47,900 --> 00:00:49,900
It is not a prediction,

17
00:00:49,900 --> 00:00:51,900
and where evidence is thin,

18
00:00:51,900 --> 00:00:53,100
it says so.

19
00:00:53,300 --> 00:00:55,300
Capital Q. Evidence before opinion.
